   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Dashboard de Transcripción de Audio con Whisper y Flask\n",
    "\n",
    "Este cuaderno Jupyter constituye el componente de backend del proyecto **Transcriptor_Audio**.\n",
    "Su función principal es orquestar la descarga de archivos de audio desde plataformas web mediante `yt-dlp` y realizar la transcripción fonética mediante el modelo Whisper de OpenAI.\n",
    "\n",
    "Adicionalmente, se implementa una interfaz de programación de aplicaciones (API) REST mediante `Flask` y `Flask-Cors` para interactuar con la interfaz de usuario web local."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Verificación e Instalación de Requisitos\n",
    "\n",
    "Para el correcto funcionamiento del backend, es indispensable contar con las librerías `openai-whisper`, `yt-dlp`, `Flask`, `Flask-Cors`, `static-ffmpeg` y la herramienta de sistema `ffmpeg` para la manipulación y decodificación de flujos de audio."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys\n",
    "import subprocess\n",
    "\n",
    "# Inicialización de ffmpeg mediante static-ffmpeg para Windows\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    import static_ffmpeg\n",
    "    static_ffmpeg.add_paths()\n",
    "    print(\"FFmpeg cargado dinámicamente mediante static-ffmpeg.\")\n",
    "except ImportError:\n",
    "    print(\"static-ffmpeg no está instalado en este entorno virtual. Intentando usar FFmpeg del PATH...\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Se verifica que ffmpeg esté instalado en el sistema de manera global\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    result = subprocess.run([\"ffmpeg\", \"-version\"], capture_output=True, text=True, check=True)\n",
    "    print(\"FFmpeg detectado correctamente:\")\n",
    "    print(result.stdout.splitlines()[0])\n",
    "except (subprocess.CalledProcessError, FileNotFoundError):\n",
    "    print(\"WARNING: FFmpeg no detectado en el PATH. Asegúrese de que esté instalado en el sistema para la extracción de audios.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Descarga y Conversión de Audios desde URL\n",
    "\n",
    "La función `download_audio` utiliza la librería `yt-dlp` para descargar de forma asíncrona flujos de audio a partir de enlaces de YouTube o TED Talks, extrayendo el contenido y convirtiéndolo a formato `.mp3` con una tasa de bits de 192 kbps."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import yt_dlp\n",
    "\n",
    "def download_audio(video_url, output_dir=\"Descarga_audio_YT\"):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Descarga el audio de un video de YouTube u otra plataforma compatible\n",
    "    y lo convierte a formato MP3.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    abs_output_dir = os.path.abspath(output_dir)\n",
    "    os.makedirs(abs_output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ydl_opts = {\n",
    "        'format': 'bestaudio/best',\n",
    "        'outtmpl': os.path.join(abs_output_dir, '%(title)s.%(ext)s'),\n",
    "        'postprocessors': [{\n",
    "            'key': 'FFmpegExtractAudio',\n",
    "            'preferredcodec': 'mp3',\n",
    "            'preferredquality': '192',\n",
    "        }],\n",
    "        'quiet': True,\n",
    "        'no_warnings': True,\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    with yt_dlp.YoutubeDL(ydl_opts) as ydl:\n",
    "        info = ydl.extract_info(video_url, download=True)\n",
    "        title = info['title']\n",
    "        mp3_filename = os.path.join(abs_output_dir, f\"{title}.mp3\")\n",
    "        return os.path.abspath(mp3_filename)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Lógica de Transcripción con OpenAI Whisper\n",
    "\n",
    "Utilizando la API de Whisper en modo local, se procede a decodificar y transcribir el flujo de audio. Se soporta el uso de diversos pesos de modelos (`tiny`, `base`, `small`, `medium`, `large`) con la capacidad opcional de restringir o autodectar el idioma del contenido."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import whisper\n",
    "\n",
    "def transcribe_audio_file(file_path, model_type=\"small\", language=None):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Transcribe un archivo de audio local utilizando Whisper.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    if not os.path.exists(file_path):\n",
    "        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"El archivo no existe en la ruta: {file_path}\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "    # Cargar el modelo en la memoria local\n",
    "    model = whisper.load_model(model_type)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Definición de argumentos de transcripción\n",
    "    options = {}\n",
    "    if language and language != \"auto\":\n",
    "        options[\"language\"] = language\n",
    "        \n",
    "    # Ejecución de la inferencia\n",
    "    result = model.transcribe(file_path, **options)\n",
    "    return result[\"text\"]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Implementación del Servidor API Flask\n",
    "\n",
    "Se expone un servidor web ligero para procesar las peticiones procedentes del panel de control web. Se implementa un hilo secundario para ejecutar las transcripciones en segundo plano, evitando de este modo que las peticiones HTTP del navegador excedan el tiempo límite de espera."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import threading\n",
    "from flask import Flask, request, jsonify, send_from_directory\n",
    "from flask_cors import CORS\n",
    "from werkzeug.utils import secure_filename\n",
    "\n",
    "# Configuración del servidor Flask apuntando al directorio web\n",
    "app = Flask(__name__, static_folder='c:/Users/angel/Desktop/Transcriptor_Audio/Pagina_Web/iest-main', static_url_path='')\n",
    "CORS(app)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Variables de estado global y sincronización\n",
    "progress = {\n",
    "    \"status\": \"idle\",  # idle, downloading, processing, completed, error\n",
    "    \"percent\": 0,\n",
    "    \"message\": \"Servidor listo para recibir peticiones.\",\n",
    "    \"transcription\": \"\",\n",
    "    \"output_dir\": \"\",\n",
    "    \"model\": \"\",\n",
    "    \"language\": \"\"\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "state_lock = threading.Lock()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Carpetas de almacenamiento\n",
    "OUTPUT_DIR = 'c:/Users/angel/Desktop/Transcriptor_Audio/Transcripciones'\n",
    "UPLOAD_DIR = 'c:/Users/angel/Desktop/Transcriptor_Audio/Codigos/temp_uploads'\n",
    "os.makedirs(OUTPUT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "os.makedirs(UPLOAD_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "def execution_thread_worker(source_type, params):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Hilo de procesamiento asíncrono para descarga y transcripción de audios.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    global progress\n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        with state_lock:\n",
    "            progress[\"status\"] = \"processing\"\n",
    "            progress[\"percent\"] = 5\n",
    "            progress[\"message\"] = \"Inicializando el flujo de transcripción...\"\n",
    "            progress[\"transcription\"] = \"\"\n",
    "            progress[\"model\"] = params.get(\"model\", \"small\")\n",
    "            progress[\"language\"] = params.get(\"language\", \"es\")\n",
    "            \n",
    "        audio_path = None\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if source_type == 'url':\n",
    "            with state_lock:\n",
    "                progress[\"percent\"] = 10\n",
    "                progress[\"message\"] = \"Descargando audio de enlace web (puede tardar unos minutos)...\"\n",
    "            audio_path = download_audio(params[\"url\"])\n",
    "            \n",
    "        elif source_type == 'local_path':\n",
    "            audio_path = params[\"local_path\"]\n",
    "            if not os.path.exists(audio_path):\n",
    "                raise FileNotFoundError(f\"No se encontró el archivo local especificado: {audio_path}\")\n",
    "                \n",
    "        elif source_type == 'upload':\n",
    "            audio_path = params[\"upload_path\"]\n",
    "            \n",
    "        # Carga del modelo Whisper\n",
    "        with state_lock:\n",
    "            progress[\"percent\"] = 30\n",
    "            progress[\"message\"] = f\"Cargando modelo Whisper '{params['model']}' en memoria (descargando pesos en la primera ejecución)...\"\n",
    "        \n",
    "        model = whisper.load_model(params[\"model\"])\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Transcripción del audio\n",
    "        with state_lock:\n",
    "            progress[\"percent\"] = 55\n",
    "            progress[\"message\"] = \"Transcribiendo y decodificando audio ( Whisper Inference )...\"\n",
    "            \n",
    "        transcribe_opts = {}\n",
    "        if params[\"language\"] != \"auto\":\n",
    "            transcribe_opts[\"language\"] = params[\"language\"]\n",
    "            \n",
    "        result = model.transcribe(audio_path, **transcribe_opts)\n",
    "        text = result.get(\"text\", \"\").strip()\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Escritura del archivo de salida de texto plano\n",
    "        safe_filename = \"\".join([c if c.isalnum() or c in (' ', '_', '-') else '_' for c in os.path.basename(audio_path)])\n",
    "        safe_filename = safe_filename.replace(' ', '_').strip('_')\n",
    "        if not safe_filename:\n",
    "            safe_filename = \"transcripcion\"\n",
    "            \n",
    "        output_txt_path = os.path.join(OUTPUT_DIR, f\"{safe_filename}.txt\")\n",
    "        with open(output_txt_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as txt_file:\n",
    "            txt_file.write(text)\n",
    "            \n",
    "        with state_lock:\n",
    "            progress[\"status\"] = \"completed\"\n",
    "            progress[\"percent\"] = 100\n",
    "            progress[\"message\"] = \"Proceso finalizado exitosamente.\"\n",
    "            progress[\"transcription\"] = text\n",
    "            progress[\"output_dir\"] = OUTPUT_DIR\n",
    "            \n",
    "    except Exception as e:\n",
    "        with state_lock:\n",
    "            progress[\"status\"] = \"error\"\n",
    "            progress[\"percent\"] = 100\n",
    "            progress[\"message\"] = f\"Error en el procesamiento: {str(e)}\"\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.route('/')\n",
    "def serve_index():\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Redirección de la raíz del servidor al transcriptor web.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    return send_from_directory(app.static_folder, 'transcriptor.html')\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.route('/<path:path>')\n",
    "def serve_static(path):\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Servicio de archivos de frontend estáticos.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    return send_from_directory(app.static_folder, path)\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.route('/api/transcribe', methods=['POST'])\n",
    "def api_start_transcription():\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Endpoint para iniciar el proceso de transcripción de audio.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    global progress\n",
    "    \n",
    "    with state_lock:\n",
    "        if progress[\"status\"] == \"processing\":\n",
    "            return jsonify({\"error\": \"Ya existe un proceso de transcripción activo en curso.\"}), 409\n",
    "            \n",
    "    # Verificación del tipo de origen (Upload multipart vs JSON)\n",
    "    if 'file' in request.files:\n",
    "        uploaded_file = request.files['file']\n",
    "        model = request.form.get('model', 'small')\n",
    "        language = request.form.get('language', 'es')\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if uploaded_file.filename == '':\n",
    "            return jsonify({\"error\": \"Archivo de subida no válido.\"}), 400\n",
    "            \n",
    "        sec_name = secure_filename(uploaded_file.filename)\n",
    "        upload_path = os.path.join(UPLOAD_DIR, sec_name)\n",
    "        uploaded_file.save(upload_path)\n",
    "        \n",
    "        params = {\n",
    "            \"upload_path\": upload_path,\n",
    "            \"model\": model,\n",
    "            \"language\": language\n",
    "        }\n",
    "        thread = threading.Thread(target=execution_thread_worker, args=('upload', params))\n",
    "        thread.start()\n",
    "        return jsonify({\"status\": \"started\"})\n",
    "        \n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        data = request.get_json()\n",
    "        if not data:\n",
    "            return jsonify({\"error\": \"Datos de petición vacíos.\"}), 400\n",
    "            \n",
    "        source_type = data.get(\"source_type\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "        params = {\n",
    "            \"model\": data.get(\"model\", \"small\"),\n",
    "            \"language\": data.get(\"language\", \"es\")\n",
    "        }\n",
    "        \n",
    "        if source_type == 'url':\n",
    "            params[\"url\"] = data.get(\"url\")\n",
    "            if not params[\"url\"]:\n",
    "                return jsonify({\"error\": \"Debe ingresar una URL válida.\"}), 400\n",
    "        elif source_type == 'local_path':\n",
    "            params[\"local_path\"] = data.get(\"local_path\")\n",
    "            if not params[\"local_path\"]:\n",
    "                return jsonify({\"error\": \"Debe especificar la ruta absoluta local.\"}), 400\n",
    "        else:\n",
    "            return jsonify({\"error\": \"Tipo de origen no especificado o no soportado.\"}), 400\n",
    "            \n",
    "        thread = threading.Thread(target=execution_thread_worker, args=(source_type, params))\n",
    "        thread.start()\n",
    "        return jsonify({\"status\": \"started\"})\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.route('/api/status', methods=['GET'])\n",
    "def api_get_status():\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Retorna el estado y avance actual del transcriptor.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    with state_lock:\n",
    "        return jsonify(progress)\n",
    "\n",
    "@app.route('/api/save_tex', methods=['POST'])\n",
    "def api_save_tex():\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    Exporta e inicializa la compilación LaTeX (.tex) de la transcripción.\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    data = request.get_json()\n",
    "    if not data or not data.get('transcription'):\n",
    "        return jsonify({\"error\": \"No se proveyó contenido de transcripción.\"}), 400\n",
    "        \n",
    "    transcription = data['transcription']\n",
    "    source = data.get('source', 'Desconocido')\n",
    "    model = data.get('model', 'small')\n",
    "    language = data.get('language', 'es')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    try:\n",
    "        # Formateo del nombre seguro de archivo\n",
    "        base_source = os.path.basename(source)\n",
    "        safe_name = \"\".join([c if c.isalnum() or c in (' ', '_', '-') else '_' for c in base_source])\n",
    "        safe_name = safe_name.replace(' ', '_').strip('_')\n",
    "        if not safe_name:\n",
    "            safe_name = \"transcripcion\"\n",
    "            \n",
    "        tex_filepath = os.path.join(OUTPUT_DIR, f\"{safe_name}.tex\")\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # Plantilla LaTeX adaptada al diseño institucional y estilo de escritura\n",
    "        tex_template = r\"\"\"\\documentclass[12pt,letterpaper]{{article}}
\\usepackage[utf8]{{inputenc}}
\\usepackage[spanish]{{babel}}
\\usepackage{{geometry}}
\\geometry{{letterpaper, margin=1in}}
\\usepackage{{xcolor}}
\\usepackage{{booktabs}}
 
\\definecolor{{IESTnavy}}{{HTML}}{{142E4C}}
\\definecolor{{IESTcyan}}{{HTML}}{{2F95A3}}
 
\\title{{\\color{{IESTnavy}}\\textbf{{Transcripción de Audio Automatizada}}}}
\\author{{Consultora IEST}}
\\date{{\\today}}
 
\\begin{{document}}
 
\\maketitle
 
\\section*{{Detalles del Procesamiento}}
\\begin{{itemize}}
    \\item \\textbf{{Origen de Datos/Archivo:}} {source}
    \\item \\textbf{{Modelo Whisper Seleccionado:}} {model}
    \\item \\textbf{{Idioma del Audio:}} {language}
    \\item \\textbf{{Ruta Local del Reporte:}} {output_dir}
\\end{{itemize}}
 
\\section*{{Transcripción de Audio}}
{transcription}
 
\\end{{document}}
\"\"\".format(\n",
            source=source.replace('_', '\\_').replace('&', '\\&'),\n",
            model=model,\n",
            language=language,\n",
            output_dir=OUTPUT_DIR.replace('\\', '/'),\n",
            transcription=transcription\n",
        )\n",
        \n",
        with open(tex_filepath, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as tex_file:\n",
        "            tex_file.write(tex_template)\n",
        "            \n",
        "        return jsonify({\"status\": \"success\", \"path\": tex_filepath})\n",
        "        \n",
        "    except Exception as e:\n",
        "        return jsonify({\"error\": f\"Error al generar archivo LaTeX: {str(e)}\"}), 500"
   ]
  },
